  "notes": "Flatbush Zombies' sole producer — *3001: A Laced Odyssey* was \"entirely produced\" by him — so this model and `flatbush-zombies` are deliberately close where the research is the same paragraph twice, and differ where his *instrumental* brief differs from the group record. The difference the research actually gives is layering and continuity: \"4- and 8-bar loops with three simultaneous layers (loop + drone + counter-line), so note density is above lane average\", plus \"cinematic intros and interludes ... he also engineers and art-directs, so album continuity is a design goal\". That is authored as `countermelody.densityRatio` 0.62 — the densest counter in this batch — carrying `arp`, `answer_lick` and a `sustain_pad` for the drone, over 8-bar phrasing, with `bridge` fixed at 8 bars as the interlude slot and `intro` at 8–12. The group entry instead spends its bars on three-MC 16-bar rotations. Everything else follows the shared paragraph: 80–100 straight with the snare on 2 and 4 is `halfTime` off and `backbeat_24`; \"loudness from parallel compression rather than clipping\" is a narrowed velocity range (accents 102–118 over mains 90–102 over ghosts at 56–68) rather than a raised one; 8th hats or a ride is `base` `8th` with `ride` in `percs.lanes`; and \"sub-808 layered under a filtered sample bass, long decay, few slides ... supports rather than leads\" is `slideProb` 0.08 with `glideProb` 0.06 and `followRootsProb` 0.86. Harmony is the documented i–VI–III–VII and i–iv–VII with m7/m9/add9 colours, so `extensions` are seventh- and ninth-weighted and `melody.colorTones` carries the 9th and 6th. ⚠ `medium` because the research rates it high-medium; sole authorship, sonic description and chart data are documented and the INFERRED parameter is the tempo, which the paragraph says is inferred. ⚠ **`lockTo808` raised from 0.4 to 0.47.** The 808 takes each kick with this probability, and at 0.4 over this model's 12-kick floor a seed could produce no 808 at all — which `bass808.rs` refuses, because a declared 808 that sometimes vanishes is a part a producer cannot rely on. It is still well under a lock: a good share of kicks carry no sub. ⚠ The bass ceiling came down from 44 to 43 so it stays under a chord part that starts at 44 — `coherence.rs` requires the highest bass note to sit at or below the lowest chord note, and this model overlapped by 1.",
